# Required. This is the only credential the bot cannot degrade without: `once`
# and `run` both fail immediately without it, while `check` and `status` do not
# need it at all. If it is already exported machine-wide, leave this commented —
# the SDK reads the environment first, and `memetrader check` will tell you
# which of the two it found.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional. Jupiter works keyless on lite-api.jup.ag, but that host has a
# deliberately decaying rate limit. A free key moves you to api.jup.ag.
# JUPITER_API_KEY=

# Optional. Without these, sentiment falls back to the keyless Arctic Shift
# source and the on-chain flow numbers. Create at reddit.com/prefs/apps ->
# "script". Takes about two minutes and costs nothing.
# REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
# REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
# REDDIT_USER_AGENT=memetrader/0.1 by u/yourname
